-serif text-orange-950\">穴原温泉　ペットと泊まれる宿　おきな旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-orange-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">お部屋が川に面しており景観が良好です。板前が作る旬の料理と郷土料理が自慢の宿です。wi-fi完備</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F20567%2F20567.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-amber-600 hover:from-orange-500 hover:to-amber-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">🍁 愛犬との旅プランを見る</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/10 via-amber-500/10 to-yellow-500/10 border border-orange-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 bg-orange-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-orange-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">長野県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-orange-800\">⭐ 4.08 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38902/38902.jpg\" alt=\"信州鹿教湯温泉　愛犬と泊まれる温泉宿　鹿鳴荘\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-orange-200\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-orange-950\">信州鹿教湯温泉　愛犬と泊まれる温泉宿　鹿鳴荘</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-orange-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">■ワンちゃんといつも一緒■当館の看板犬シェリがおもてなし★温泉街中心に位置するカフェ併設の旅館です！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/